      "content": "This policy is not about ignoring systemic issues but about preventing the workplace from becoming a toxic arena where ideological battles distract from actual productivity and innovation. True inclusivity means creating a neutral ground where diverse views can coexist without one group dominating the conversation or harassing others, which is exactly what happens when internal channels become political battlegrounds. We must distinguish between private advocacy and professional conduct to ensure that our firm remains a place where people work together to solve problems, rather than fighting over who gets to lead the charge on social issues.",
